"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">17</div><h1>재귀동사</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Reflexive Verben</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 17의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>A2 수준의 문장으로, 기본 16 · 중간 8 · 도전 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">인칭에 맞는 재귀대명사를 써요 — 3인칭과 존칭은 sich</div><div class=\"x-goal\">다른 4격 목적어가 있으면 재귀대명사를 3격으로 바꿔요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">재귀대명사를 알맞은 자리에 놓고, '서로'의 뜻을 구별해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">sich freuen auf/über처럼 전치사와 함께 쓰는 재귀동사를 써요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Das Taxi wartet schon. Du musst <span class=\"qblank\"></span> beeilen!</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) dir</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) dich</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) sich</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) du</button></div><div class=\"qe\">sich beeilen은 늘 재귀대명사와 써요.<br>다른 4격 목적어가 없으니 du → dich예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Nach der Arbeit erholt <span class=\"qblank\"></span> mein Opa im Garten.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) er</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) ihm</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) sich</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) ihn</button></div><div class=\"qe\">주어(mein Opa) 자신을 가리키는 3인칭 재귀대명사는 sich예요.<br>ihn이면 다른 남자가 돼요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;bedanken&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Er <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(bedanken)</span> sich bei uns für die Einladung.</div><div class=\"qko\">그는 초대해 줘서 고맙다고 우리에게 인사해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Er <b>bedanken</b> sich bei uns für die Einladung.</div>sich bedanken bei + 3격(누구에게) für + 4격(무엇을)이에요.<br>er → bedankt.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;euch&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Im Winter müsst ihr <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(ihr)</span> warm anziehen.</div><div class=\"qko\">겨울에는 너희 옷을 따뜻하게 입어야 해.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Im Winter müsst ihr <b>euch</b> warm anziehen.</div>다른 4격 목적어가 없으니 재귀대명사는 4격이에요.<br>ihr → euch.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;mich&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Entschuldigung, ich habe <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> geirrt.</div><div class=\"qko\">죄송해요, 제가 착각했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Entschuldigung, ich habe <b>mich</b> geirrt.</div>sich irren은 늘 재귀로 써요.<br>ich → mich, 재귀동사의 현재완료는 haben이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Hier ist Kuchen. Bitte bedienen Sie <span class=\"qblank\"></span>! (마음껏 드세요)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Ihnen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Sie</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) sich</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Sich</button></div><div class=\"qe\">존칭 Sie의 재귀대명사는 sich예요.<br>Sie는 대문자로 쓰지만 sich는 언제나 소문자예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;dir&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Wäschst du <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> vor dem Essen die Hände?</div><div class=\"qko\">밥 먹기 전에 손 씻니?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wäschst du <b>dir</b> vor dem Essen die Hände?</div>다른 4격 목적어(die Hände)가 있으니 재귀대명사는 3격이에요.<br>du → dir.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Jeden Morgen rasiert er sich im Bad&quot;,&quot;Er rasiert sich jeden Morgen im Bad&quot;,&quot;Im Bad rasiert er sich jeden Morgen&quot;,&quot;Er rasiert sich im Bad jeden Morgen&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그는 아침마다 욕실에서 면도를 해요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Morgen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">rasiert</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Jeden</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">im</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">er</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Bad</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">sich</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Jeden Morgen rasiert er sich im Bad.</b></div>주어가 대명사(er)면 재귀대명사 sich는 주어 바로 뒤에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> Heute ziehe ich <span class=\"qblank\"></span> den Pullover an.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) sich</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) mich</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) mir</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) mein</button></div><div class=\"qe\">다른 4격 목적어(den Pullover)가 있으니 재귀대명사는 3격이에요 — ich → mir.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> Mein Sohn wünscht <span class=\"qblank\"></span> zum Geburtstag einen Hund. (아들 자신이 갖고 싶어 해요)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) ihn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) sich</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) mir</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) ihm</button></div><div class=\"qe\">sich etwas wünschen은 3격 재귀대명사와 써요.<br>3인칭 주어는 3격도 sich예요. ihm이면 다른 사람이 돼요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;euch&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> Merkt <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(ihr)</span> bitte die Telefonnummer!</div><div class=\"qko\">너희, 전화번호 꼭 기억해 둬!</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Merkt <b>euch</b> bitte die Telefonnummer!</div>sich etwas merken은 3격 재귀대명사예요.<br>ihr의 3격도 euch라서 모양이 같아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;sich&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> Anna und Tom kennen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> seit der Schule.</div><div class=\"qko\">안나와 톰은 학창 시절부터 서로 알아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Anna und Tom kennen <b>sich</b> seit der Schule.</div>주어가 여럿이면 sich가 '서로'라는 뜻이 돼요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> Interessierst du dich <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Geschichte?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) für</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) über</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) an</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) auf</button></div><div class=\"qe\">sich interessieren für + 4격(~에 관심이 있다)이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;auf&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> Wir freuen uns schon <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(앞으로의 일)</span> die Sommerferien.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 벌써 여름방학이 기다려져요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wir freuen uns schon <b>auf</b> die Sommerferien.</div>아직 오지 않은 일을 기대할 때는 sich freuen auf + 4격이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;um&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> Unsere Nachbarin kümmert sich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> unsere Katze.</div><div class=\"qko\">이웃집 아주머니가 우리 고양이를 돌봐 줘요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Unsere Nachbarin kümmert sich <b>um</b> unsere Katze.</div>sich kümmern um + 4격(~을 돌보다)이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Heute treffe ich mich mit meiner Cousine&quot;,&quot;Ich treffe mich heute mit meiner Cousine&quot;,&quot;Mit meiner Cousine treffe ich mich heute&quot;,&quot;Ich treffe mich mit meiner Cousine heute&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">오늘 나는 사촌 언니와 만나요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">treffe</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">meiner</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Cousine</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Heute</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">mit</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">mich</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Heute treffe ich mich mit meiner Cousine.</b></div>sich treffen mit + 3격이에요.<br>heute가 앞에 오면 동사 → 주어 ich → 재귀대명사 mich 순서예요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;mir&quot;],[&quot;mich&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> Nach dem Sport dusche ich, wasche <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> die Haare und ziehe <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> an.</div><div class=\"qko\">운동이 끝나면 샤워하고, 머리를 감고, 옷을 입어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Nach dem Sport dusche ich, wasche <b>mir</b> die Haare und ziehe <b>mich</b> an.</div>die Haare라는 4격이 따로 있으니 첫 번째는 3격 mir예요.<br>anziehen 뒤에 다른 4격이 없으니 두 번째는 4격 mich예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> '오늘 우리는 일찍 작별 인사를 해요.'</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Heute verabschieden wir uns früh.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Heute verabschieden wir früh uns.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Heute verabschieden uns wir früh.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Heute wir verabschieden uns früh.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">도치 문장에서 동사는 두 번째, 주어가 대명사면 재귀대명사는 주어 바로 뒤예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;über&quot;],[&quot;auf&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> Ich freue mich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> deine Postkarte aus Spanien. Und ich freue mich schon <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> unser Treffen im Mai.</div><div class=\"qko\">스페인에서 보낸 네 엽서 받아서 기뻐. 그리고 5월에 만나는 게 벌써 기다려져.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich freue mich <b>über</b> deine Postkarte aus Spanien. Und ich freue mich schon <b>auf</b> unser Treffen im Mai.</div>이미 받은 엽서를 기뻐할 때는 über, 아직 오지 않은 만남을 기대할 때는 auf예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wir haben uns im Urlaub gut erholt&quot;,&quot;Im Urlaub haben wir uns gut erholt&quot;,&quot;Wir haben uns gut im Urlaub erholt&quot;,&quot;Gut haben wir uns im Urlaub erholt&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 휴가 때 잘 쉬었어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">uns</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">erholt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">gut</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Urlaub</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">im</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">haben</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wir haben uns im Urlaub gut erholt.</b></div>재귀동사의 현재완료는 haben이에요.<br>재귀대명사 uns는 주어 대명사 바로 뒤, 과거분사 erholt는 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;bei&quot;],[&quot;der&quot;],[&quot;für&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> Paul entschuldigt sich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(누구에게)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(Lehrerin · 여성)</span> Lehrerin <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(무엇을)</span> die Verspätung.</div><div class=\"qko\">파울은 선생님께 늦은 것을 사과드려요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Paul entschuldigt sich <b>bei</b> <b>der</b> Lehrerin <b>für</b> die Verspätung.</div>sich entschuldigen bei + 3격(누구에게) für + 4격(무엇을)이에요.<br>bei der Lehrerin · für die Verspätung.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> Nach dem Streit sprechen die Nachbarn nicht mehr <span class=\"qblank\"></span>.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) sich mit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) miteinander</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) mitsich</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) einander mit</button></div><div class=\"qe\">'서로 함께'는 전치사와 einander를 한 단어로 써요 — miteinander.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> Das Auto kostet 50.000 Euro. Kannst du <span class=\"qblank\"></span> das Auto wirklich leisten?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) dich</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) dir</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) sich</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) dein</button></div><div class=\"qe\">sich etwas leisten은 3격 재귀대명사와 써요.<br>4격 목적어(das Auto)가 따로 있어서 du → dir예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;euch&quot;],[&quot;an&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> Erinnert ihr <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(ihr)</span> noch <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(전치사)</span> unseren Mathelehrer?</div><div class=\"qko\">너희 우리 수학 선생님 아직 기억해?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Erinnert ihr <b>euch</b> noch <b>an</b> unseren Mathelehrer?</div>sich erinnern an + 4격이에요.<br>ihr → euch, an unseren Mathelehrer.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Er hat sich eine Jacke gekauft.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Wir haben uns lange über das Konzert unterhalten.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Hast du dir schon für den Kurs angemeldet?</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Ich habe mir gestern den Arm gebrochen.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">sich anmelden에는 다른 4격 목적어가 없으니 재귀대명사가 4격이에요 — Hast du dich schon für den Kurs angemeldet?<br>den Arm·eine Jacke가 있는 문장은 3격 mir·sich가 맞아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;mir&quot;],[&quot;mich&quot;],[&quot;mich&quot;],[&quot;über&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> Morgens wasche ich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> das Gesicht, ziehe <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> schnell an und beeile <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\">. Im Bus ärgere ich mich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(전치사)</span> die Musik meines Nachbarn.</div><div class=\"qko\">아침에 나는 세수를 하고 얼른 옷을 입고 서둘러요. 버스에서는 옆자리 사람의 음악 때문에 짜증이 나요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Morgens wasche ich <b>mir</b> das Gesicht, ziehe <b>mich</b> schnell an und beeile <b>mich</b>. Im Bus ärgere ich mich <b>über</b> die Musik meines Nachbarn.</div>das Gesicht가 있는 waschen은 3격 mir, 다른 4격이 없는 anziehen·beeilen은 mich예요.<br>sich ärgern über + 4격이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> '파울은 아들에게 재킷을 입혀요.'</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Paul zieht seinen Sohn die Jacke an.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Paul zieht sich seinem Sohn die Jacke an.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Paul zieht sich die Jacke an.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Paul zieht seinem Sohn die Jacke an.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">다른 사람에게 입히면 재귀대명사를 쓰지 않아요.<br>입는 사람은 3격(seinem Sohn), 옷은 4격(die Jacke)이에요. sich die Jacke는 파울 자신이 입는 거예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Am Montag muss ich mich um die Kinder meiner Schwester kümmern&quot;,&quot;Ich muss mich am Montag um die Kinder meiner Schwester kümmern&quot;,&quot;Um die Kinder meiner Schwester muss ich mich am Montag kümmern&quot;,&quot;Ich muss mich um die Kinder meiner Schwester am Montag kümmern&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">월요일에 나는 언니의 아이들을 돌봐야 해요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">kümmern</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Montag</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Am</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Schwester</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Kinder</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">muss</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">mich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">meiner</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">um</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"10\">die</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Am Montag muss ich mich um die Kinder meiner Schwester kümmern.</b></div>화법조동사 muss는 두 번째, kümmern은 끝이에요.<br>mich는 주어 ich 바로 뒤, um + 4격 die Kinder 뒤에 2격 meiner Schwester가 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;mir&quot;],[&quot;mich&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> Heute Abend sehe ich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> das Fußballspiel an. Danach lege ich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> sofort ins Bett.</div><div class=\"qko\">오늘 저녁에 축구 경기를 볼 거예요. 그다음에는 바로 침대에 누울 거예요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Heute Abend sehe ich <b>mir</b> das Fußballspiel an. Danach lege ich <b>mich</b> sofort ins Bett.</div>sich etwas ansehen은 3격이라서 mir예요(4격 das Fußballspiel이 따로 있어요).<br>sich legen에는 다른 4격이 없으니 mich예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> '고양이 두 마리가 서로의 털을 핥아 줘요.'를 '서로'의 뜻이 분명하게 나타낸 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Die Katzen putzen gegenseitig.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Die Katzen putzen sich.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Die Katzen putzen sich gegenseitig.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Die Katzen putzen sich einander.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">sich만 쓰면 '각자 자기 몸을'인지 '서로'인지 분명하지 않아요.<br>gegenseitig를 sich와 함께 쓰면 '서로'가 분명해요. einander는 sich 없이 써요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"30\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 30</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"